      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_payload_lookup_must_reject_malformed_payload_tlv",
      "fine_trace_step": 1,
      "description": "Root cause. NFLOG TLV size is taken verbatim from `recordLen` instead of being aligned to 4 bytes, so a padded `NFULA_PREFIX` record contributes 5 bytes instead of its real 8-byte footprint. That under-advance is what lets later traversal step into padding and reinterpret later bytes as another TLV."
    },
